/**
 * Staging Environment Configuration Template
 * 
 * Copy this file to config/local.php on the ISOLATED STAGING server only.
 * DO NOT use production database credentials.
 * DO NOT point to production domains.
 * DO NOT enable live outbound email delivery to real employees.
